{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122985","id":4393216108,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBdsobA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122985","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122985.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122985.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122985","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122985/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122985/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122985/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cb9a8b6e470b378105b723ab0a28d49198aac98f","number":122985,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix error when creating a new GDScript from a resource picker","user":{"login":"X-LegendaryGames","id":20563568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNTYzNTY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20563568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/X-LegendaryGames","html_url":"https://github.com/X-LegendaryGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X-LegendaryGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X-LegendaryGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X-LegendaryGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X-LegendaryGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X-LegendaryGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X-LegendaryGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X-LegendaryGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X-LegendaryGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X-LegendaryGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nWhen attempting to create a new root script on directly from a Resource Picker, it'll instead generate an error message:\r\n`\r\nERROR: Resource file not found: res://::GDScript_xxxxx (expected type: Script)\r\nat: _load (core/io/resource_loader.cpp:325)\r\n`\r\nFor example:\r\n<img width=\"644\" height=\"39\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-08-29 17-25-37\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae85db66-a402-48ce-afcf-c72337da2fd8\" />\r\n\r\nThis problem does not happen if a new script is instantiated as a node.\r\nIt is described with further details at Issue https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118407\r\n\r\n## What has been changed:\r\n\r\nThis solution hides the option to create a new GDScript, instead you've to manually create one and select the option to load it.\r\n#### Before\r\n<img width=\"285\" height=\"458\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-08-31 19-08-23\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c9c5855-ca3c-49df-abe1-d07950f348b5\" />\r\n\r\n#### After\r\n<img width=\"292\" height=\"420\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-08-29 17-28-16\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/76e61e4d-9cac-4ff0-96a6-bba3620903b9\" />\r\n\r\nIt does not affect other resources loaders, like this one:\r\n<img width=\"434\" height=\"978\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-08-31 20-43-05\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34a83096-f6d0-4374-9888-21c949f4d75d\" />\r\n\r\n## Technical overview:\r\n\r\nI tried to hide the option to create a new script directly from \"resource picker\". I also had to hide the 'categories' from any resource picker based on Scripts, so there won't be a \"New\" category with no available option to choose. This doesn't affect resource pickers from other objects, such as sprites.\r\n\r\n## Possible risk:\r\n\r\nAs far I can tell, script only has \"'new' category\", however, if someone decide to add another one in the future, it might get hidden as well.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/re